This folder contains a minimal vendored runtime subset of:

BigStationW/ComfyUi-Untwisting-RoPE
https://github.com/BigStationW/ComfyUi-Untwisting-RoPE

It is included for ETUR internal runtime use only. ETUR does not expose the
upstream ComfyUI native NODE_CLASS_MAPPINGS from this vendored package, so it
does not conflict with a separately installed upstream custom node.
